ration. Neither stage moves, reserves, splits, consumes, returns, duplicates or repairs matter; each source quantity must remain represented only in its actual existing containment. Conflicting inventory and placement claims are reported, not resolved by granting either stock or an arrangement. Report an available next operation only when supported by current state: source-bound-joining-trial inspect(arrangementId) costs one round/0.2 energy, or recover(arrangementId) costs one round/0.5 energy, each requiring a genuinely existing accessible exact arrangement. Existing individual learning for that ability remains two rounds at 0.2 energy per round if not already learned; the reconciliation adapter grants no mastery. Recovery remains a separate deliberate action preserving actual source identities, quantities and condition. Resume/cancel of old work requires the exact processId and a verified applicable existing stage; an orphan marker does not authorize either physical work or free recovery. Do not invoke assess, wrap, recover, repair or cleanup automatically. Reconciliation work has one atomic paid record stage and at most one separately authorized atomic local stage. Save completed report/progress under an exact new reconciliation process ID distinct from manual-88-lin-522. Interruption before a stage commits makes no charge or finding for that stage; after commit retain paid evidence. Resume revalidates access and performs only the outstanding authorized stage. Cancel or death ends outstanding reconciliation work without deleting historical reports, changing the original trial, relocating matter or refunding completed effort. No ongoing process, automatic retry, passive progress or maintenance charge. Development/review waiting advances no world time. The sole product is bounded dated evidence and conditional executable operation references, including an unresolved discrepancy when necessary; no strength, utility, comfort, nutrition, ownership, permission or mastery effect. Implement these checks and transitions in deterministic code rather than repeated model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No pleasure or satisfaction is awarded for this request, learning, registration, report creation, query, or repeated unchanged comparison. This minimal version grants no experience reward. Its informational product can include a genuinely informative unresolved discrepancy, but that does not itself authorize reward creation. Any future integration with an existing grounded-information rule must verify a real personally applicable evidence-changing event, deduplicate by functional finding/source transition rather than operation name, and enforce that rule's bounded amount, cap, decay and cooldown in code. No changes to protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions; no physical comfort or nutrition bonus.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Use a reusable report/observation overlay with metadata containing actor, reconciliation process ID, exact referenced IDs, evidence timestamp, access scope, completeness, phase, paid/remaining work and status such as pending, observed, historical-only, inaccessible or unresolved. Emit report-completed only after the paid comparison commits; completion means the review finished, not that an arrangement exists or recovery succeeded. Emit physical-observation-verified only after successful local verification. Failed or interrupted stages display their actual failure/pending status, never a success checkmark. Do not spawn a loose-wrap object, render an inferred location, show a restored material stack or mark the joining trial recovered. Any existing physical object's rendering remains tied to its actual observable state; private report contents are not automatically communicated to others.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

